  ('memo_1792906228416', 'admin@hrhub.com', 'MEMO-2026-5ARG-261025-02', 'OCTOBER 2,6 2026', 'ALL CONCERNED ', 'HUMAN RESOURCES DEPARTMENT', 'WORK ARRANGEMENT FOR ALL SAINT''S DAY AND ALL SOUL''S DAY', 'Mandatory Compliance', '5a_royal', '<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []">In observance of <b>All Saints’ Day </b>and <b>All Souls’ Day</b>, <b>Christian employees</b> may take one (1) day of rest on either <b>November 1 or 2, 2026</b>, to visit the resting places of their departed loved ones. This arrangement shall be implemented on a strict rotational basis, with duty schedules coordinated in advance through the respective HR On-Site personnel or Customer Service Representatives (CSRs) in their assigned areas.</p><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><br></p><p>As STL operations shall continue as usual, all concerned personnel must maintain proper coordination, active communication, and strict adherence to assigned duty schedules to ensure uninterrupted operations.</p><p><br></p><p>For guidance and strict compliance.</p>', 'Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif', 14.6, 'single', 'JEVINCE JAYE S. JUBAY, CHRP', 'HRMD Manager', 'CHARMIE JEAN M. SIMPAL', 'President & CEO', '{"approverSize":118,"approverLabel":"NOTED & APPROVED BY:","signatorySize":80,"signatoryLabel":"","approverOffsetX":0,"approverOffsetY":-45,"signatoryOffsetX":-12,"signatoryOffsetY":-38,"approverSignature":"data:image/png;base64,","signatorySignature":"data:image/png;base64,"}'::jsonb, '2026-10-25T05:30:28.434+00:00', '2026-10-25T05:30:28.434+00:00'),
